    "language": "en",
    "text": " Thank you. Very valuable information for us. Not many researchers might be working with many different dialects like you are, so this was very good. And would you say that speakers need to be identified in the transcription? Is it important for you that the transcription output recognizes who is speaking? Not absolutely necessary, but it would make my life easier if the software could do that. And do you consider that your data contains sensitive information? Occasionally, yes. So privacy is a concern and I cannot use a transcription tool which gives access to the audio to some third party. For example, as AI trading material. That's not possible. Okay."
